<title>UK: IFC sets 250 million stg three-year bond.</title>
<headline>IFC sets 250 million stg three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Yamaichi International (Europe) Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   International Finance Corporation</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN STG   COUPON     6.34 PCT  MATURITY    17.FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.10     PAY DATE   S19.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  20 BP     REOFFER    =	   S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    UNLISTED  PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
